"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o027c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-a4ddc7737d2e7414ba8e","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，壬寅〖10〗，行幸许昌宫。甲子〖11〗，初进新果于庙。五月，皇子殷薨，追封谥安平哀王。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：太和六年（公元 232）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d1427f90b1f8dd585e5a","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：太和五年（公元 231 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-99c1873dc57e954cfdf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o021","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b3a0b254d489f1ed2693","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，帝耕于籍田。三月，大司马曹真薨。诸葛亮寇天水。诏大将军司马宣王拒之。自去冬十月至此月，不雨。辛巳〖2〗，大雩〖3〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o023","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-d5960e029c810e0fce0a","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，丙子〖6〗，以亮退走，封爵、增位各有差。﹝一﹞乙酉〖7〗，皇子殷生。大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o026","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-42d0ed5edde34d9ea9f5","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，诏曰：“古之帝王，封建诸侯，所以藩屏王室也〖2〗。《诗》不云乎，‘怀德维宁，宗子维城’〖3〗。秦、汉继周，或强或弱〖4〗，俱失厥中〖5〗。大魏创业，诸王开国；随时之宜，未有定制：非所以永为后法也。其改封诸侯王，皆以郡为国〖6〗。”三月，癸酉〖7〗，行东巡；所过存问高年鳏寡孤独〖8〗，赐谷帛。乙亥〖9〗，月犯轩辕大星。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o027","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-a4ddc7737d2e7414ba8e","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，壬寅〖10〗，行幸许昌宫。甲子〖11〗，初进新果于庙。五月，皇子殷薨，追封谥安平哀王。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
